    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d543">

                <pb facs="0600" n="588" sameAs="frus:frus1942v05/pg588"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">824.6363 St. 2/564: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Bolivian Minister for Foreign Affairs</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Anze Matienzo</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                        Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">La
                                Paz</hi></placeName> [<date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content-and-sibling-dates"
                            calendar="gregorian" notAfter="1942-02-12T00:18:00-04:00"
                            notBefore="1942-01-28T00:00:00-05:00">undated</date>].<lb/>[Received
                        February 12—12:18 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I have the honor to communicate to Your Excellency that my Government today
                    approved the agreement between the Government of Bolivia and the Standard Oil
                    Company of New Jersey signed at Rio de Janeiro January 27 of the current
                        year.<anchor n="45" xml:id="d543-f1"/> In this connection I cherish the
                    assurance that the relations between our respective countries will be as
                    hitherto and even more cordial in the future for our mutual benefit.</p>
                <p>I present to Your Excellency [etc.]</p>
                <closer><signed>E. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Anze Matienzo</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d543-f1" n="45" xml:id="d543-f1-content">
                <p>The agreement was put into effect by a decree of February 24, 1942.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
